@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@visitorAccessToken =
@otherVisitorAccessToken =
@operatorAccessToken =
@otherOperatorAccessToken =
@reservationId =
@cancelledReservationNo =
@completedSessionReservationNo =
@manualReservationNo =
@qrToken =
@tamperedQrToken = invalid.qr.token
@qrCheckInIdempotencyKey = qr-check-in-{{$uuid}}
@manualCheckInIdempotencyKey = manual-check-in-{{$uuid}}
@manualDuplicateIdempotencyKey = manual-duplicate-{{$uuid}}

# P0 QR 발급/QR 체크인/수동 체크인
# 선행 조건:
# - reservationId는 QR 체크인용 CONFIRMED 예약 ID여야 한다.
# - manualReservationNo는 수동 체크인용 별도 CONFIRMED 예약번호여야 한다.
# - 두 정상 체크인 대상은 서로 다른 예약이어야 한다.
# - 체크인 가능 시간대, 콘텐츠 소유 운영자 토큰이 필요하다.

### 1. 내 예약 QR 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

> {%
client.global.set("qrToken", response.body.data.qrToken);
%}

### 2. 타인 예약 QR 조회 - 403 FORBIDDEN 기대
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{otherVisitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. QR 체크인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{qrCheckInIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{qrToken}}"
}

### 4. QR 체크인 반복 - 같은 응답 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{qrCheckInIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{qrToken}}"
}

### 5. QR 변조 - 400 QR_VERIFICATION_FAILED 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: tampered-{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{tamperedQrToken}}"
}

### 6. QR 체크인 Idempotency-Key 누락 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{qrToken}}"
}

### 7. 타 운영자 QR 체크인 - 403 FORBIDDEN 또는 409 CHECK_IN_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{otherOperatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: other-operator-{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{qrToken}}"
}

### 8. 예약번호 수동 체크인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{manualCheckInIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{manualReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

### 9. 예약번호 수동 체크인 반복 - 같은 응답 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{manualCheckInIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{manualReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

### 10. 수동 사유 누락 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: reason-missing-{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{manualReservationNo}}",
  "reason": ""
}

### 11. 같은 Idempotency-Key 다른 요청 - 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{manualDuplicateIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{manualReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

### 12. 같은 Idempotency-Key 다른 예약번호 - 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{manualDuplicateIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{cancelledReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

### 13. 취소 예약 수동 체크인 - 409 CHECK_IN_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: cancelled-{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{cancelledReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

### 14. 완료 회차 예약 수동 체크인 - 409 CHECK_IN_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/check-ins/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: completed-session-{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reservationNo": "{{completedSessionReservationNo}}",
  "reason": "QR_SCAN_FAILED"
}

# DB 확인
